WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.227 --> 00:00:01.060
(lively music)

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.150
- [Narrator] This is Tango.

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:07.070
She's a yellow-headed Amazon
and extremely intelligent,

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:09.347
personable and talkative parrot.

00:00:09.347 --> 00:00:11.075
(faint squawking)

00:00:11.075 --> 00:00:13.583
I think Tango is
uncharacteristically quiet today.

00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:16.166
(lively music)

00:00:17.855 --> 00:00:18.920
(faint flapping)

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.190
Native to Mexico and
Northwestern Central America,

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:24.993
adult yellow-headed
Amazons are identified by,

00:00:24.993 --> 00:00:27.900
you guessed it, their full yellow heads.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.550
The rest of their body
is green with some yellow

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.870
and red visible on the
bend of their wings.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.520
They make their homes in
forests and wooded areas

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:41.480
and subsist on a diet of
fruits, berries, nuts and seeds.

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:43.740
The yellow-headed Amazon

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:46.790
has been a prized pet
parrot for centuries.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:48.850
Lively, voluble birds; they can hold

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:50.570
an impressive vocabulary

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:53.310
which only contributes to their demand.

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:55.550
Although captive-bred
yellow-headed Amazons

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:56.800
can be owned,

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.540
they continue to be poached
illegally in the wild,

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.440
which is why they're endangered.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.410
Over the past two decades only,

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:05.790
their numbers outside of
captivity have plummeted

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:07.910
to a tenth of its former population,

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:10.110
making their situation precarious.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.200
This is the yellow-headed Amazon.

00:01:14.284 --> 00:01:15.523
(lively music)

00:01:15.523 --> 00:01:16.930
(fluttering)

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:19.513
(techno tones)

